WEBVTT

00:04:31.903 --> 00:04:33.813
Currently, I'm not watching the child.

00:04:33.837 --> 00:04:34.988
She's really focused.

00:04:35.012 --> 00:04:36.162
I turn around.

00:04:37.588 --> 00:04:38.620
(Laughter)

00:04:38.644 --> 00:04:40.844
She wasn't doing anything, right?

00:04:43.596 --> 00:04:45.347
In study two, it's the two remotes,

00:04:45.371 --> 00:04:47.918
one with the positive
and one with the negative value.

00:04:47.942 --> 00:04:49.609
I'm currently observing the child.

00:04:49.633 --> 00:04:52.139
And the orange remote
is a negative remote.

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:56.052
She's just looking around,
looking at me, hanging out.

00:04:56.494 --> 00:04:57.761
Then I turn around ...